        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/b6d7e6b47919ec7ec7b7d0c89eb59a2e.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/b6d7e6b47919ec7ec7b7d0c89eb59a2e.webm?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/b6d7e6b47919ec7ec7b7d0c89eb59a2e.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >「氷点下30度の絶望」は極限状態での人間の狂気とやさしさを描いたビジュアルノベルです。</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>苦しんでいる人間が好き、生きようと足掻く人間が好きという方以外はプレイしないでください。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >また、以下に苦手な要素がある方はプレイしないでください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>閉鎖空間、複雑な親子関係、ペット（節足動物）の死、軽いホラー、喫煙、罵倒、怪我、流血、暴力、殺人、自殺</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/6c33c25bb57f028e4499361e27a9204d.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/6c33c25bb57f028e4499361e27a9204d.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/28cd5fa4451dcc3363d4fa896519025a.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >サクッと重いストーリー</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1周約15分</strong>、マウスのみの<strong>簡単操作</strong>で<strong>重い会話、過去、展開</strong>を味わえます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/cde511bf7597d6f2e259080c5954b00e.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/cde511bf7597d6f2e259080c5954b00e.webm?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/cde511bf7597d6f2e259080c5954b00e.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/31e29d2b7d480979d9dd52fff3b5f0f4.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>4つの死に様</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >エンディングは4つ。<strong>全て死亡します</strong>。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/c145e87a76e215f1c5f1405578efe595.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/c145e87a76e215f1c5f1405578efe595.webm?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/c145e87a76e215f1c5f1405578efe595.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/808f44889a2fea5dbf56fd0a4868c366.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >収集要素</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >選択肢によって起こる<strong>特別な会話</strong>や、確率によって起こる<strong>ランダムイベント</strong>があり、長く楽しめます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完全回収にはスキップを用いて0.5~1時間程度かかります。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/235fa925de0f8e039c1afa8d0938bd05.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/235fa925de0f8e039c1afa8d0938bd05.webm?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/235fa925de0f8e039c1afa8d0938bd05.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/9f8d54b0e629b7e49c1fd7c75f8701f7.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCP財団リスペクト</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作者が<strong>中学生の時にSCP財団に影響を受けて作った世界観</strong>で物語は進みます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >現代日本のようで死の恐怖が迫りくるアンバランスをどうぞ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※特定のSCPオブジェクト・関連団体は登場しません。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >実況について</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全編可能です。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >必ず概要欄か固定コメントに「フリーゲーム」「作品タイトル」「みつどもえ工房」「作者Xへのリンク」の全てを記載してください。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ネタバレへの配慮は必要ありません。しかし、有料会員限定での公開は禁止です。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >また、無言プレイ動画等オリジナル要素の無い動画は禁止です。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加えて、ゲームへの暴言は禁止ですが、キャラクターの性格・行動への暴言、キャラクターへのセクハラはOKです。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/134815d7c37853435279634f7330276d.poster.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/134815d7c37853435279634f7330276d.webm?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/134815d7c37853435279634f7330276d.mp4?t=1777079232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736150/extras/3dea57cb75dd3b35fccdc8b119ebfe5c.avif?t=1777079232\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >前作フリーゲーム「推しの大切な人に成り代わる～誰もあなたを愛さない～」の過去の話となりますが、本作品単体でもお楽しみいただけます。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2025年11月3日に公開予定です。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>同時にスマホ対応のブラウザ版も公開予定です。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>最新情報は公式X（@mitsudomoe03）からご覧いただけます。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
